From 7700c982e2cb9b9e2a9ee76aa71ec24b8bd7b7e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:38:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/55] Add one-time post-game encounters for all legendaries

- Mew, Celebi and the three beasts appear as sprites after the first
  Hall of Fame; Regis, Kyogre/Groudon/Rayquaza, Latias/Latios and Jirachi
  are hidden spots (generated by tools/hack/legendaries.py)
- First Hall of Fame also gives the Mystic and Aurora Tickets
  (Navel Rock: Lugia/Ho-Oh, Birth Island: Deoxys)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
